# This must match the `github.com/livekit/protocol` pseudo-version in the Go
# server's go.mod: a Rust media node that joins a live Go cluster has to speak
# the same wire protocol as the Go nodes it is joining. `cargo xtask proto-sync
# --check` enforces it, and the `check` CI job runs that.
#
# `options.proto` at the top level is livekit/psrpc's
# protoc-gen-psrpc/options/options.proto, which the rpc/*.proto files import.
